Completing a day's key scene unlocks the next chapter. When your calendar date changes, the saved state advances one step toward that unlocked day. It avoids skipping ahead if you have been away for weeks, and day eleven gracefully wraps back to day one. The browser port keeps this progress in local storage.

Environmental details run on their own schedules. The tide rises and falls on a thirty-minute cycle; holiday decorations appear on specific calendar dates. The raft's construction progress, the island's position, and day-night lighting shifts all belong to the director's scheduler.

